// Power Set : Stone Melee 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P635704859" "Stone Melee"
// DisplayHelp :
"P211611681" "You can use the powers of earth and stone to do battle with your foes. Stone Melee allows you to strike with fists of stone, summon earthen weapons, and even quake the very ground itself."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stone Fist 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4250901496" "Stone Fist"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1250278023" "Melee Moderate DMG(Smashing), Foe Minor Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1095291228" "Your stone covered fists attack swiftly for moderate damage, and may Disorient your opponent. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3492382657" "{PlayerSource} smashes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stone Mallet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4118538781" "Stone Mallet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3309440621" "Melee, High DMG(Smashing), Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1637601056" "Your control over the earth allows you to form a mallet of solid stone. This Stone Mallet deals heavy damage, and can knock down weak foes. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heavy Mallet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3310111834" "Heavy Mallet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3207137806" "Melee, Superior DMG(Smashing), Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P724724503" "A more impressive form of Stone Mallet, the Heavy Mallet deals more damage, but is slower to swing. It has a greater chance of knocking down opponents. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1115582209" "You tap into your earthen core with your {PowerName} and are more accurate and more deadly for a short while."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fault 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1578234279" "Fault"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4055559530" "Close (Targeted AoE), Foe Knockback, Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3624615103" "This powerful stomp can cause a seismic disturbance. This will crack the Earth itself and send a Fault towards a targeted foe, throwing him and nearby enemies into the air and possibly Disorienting them. Fault deals no damage on its own. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Taunt 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

