// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1125725002" "Ranged, Foe -Speed, -Rech, Self +Speed, +Rech"
// Power Help Text :
"P4118447933" "You can Siphon the speed from a targeted foe, Slowing his movement and attack rate while boosting your own. Recharge: Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3456448981" "Your {PowerName} has slowed the attack and movement speed of {PlayerDest} while increasing your own!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P819636694" "{PlayerSource} hits you with {PowerName} decreasing your attack and movement speed!"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1490875287" "-SPD, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3187278069" "Your Running Speed potential has been altered.  If this is a friendly power, your Running Speed is increased.  If you were attacked with this power, though, your Running Speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3760447537" "You {PowerName} from {PlayerDest} to increase your own!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1887331290" "{PlayerSource} slows you with {PowerName} to increase their own!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Increase Density 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3687435012" "Increase Density"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1601178268" "Ranged, Ally Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P556727047" "Increases an ally's mass, freeing him from any Disorient, Immobilization, or Hold effects and leaving him resistant to such effects for a while. Increase Density also protects the target from Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as Smashing and Energy damage. Because the target grows more dense, their movement speed is Slowed. Although the Damage Resistance and slowing effect will not stack with multiple applications, the rest of the effects of Increase Density will. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1924523378" "You protect {PlayerDest} from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage with your {PowerName} power."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3719467599" "{PlayerSource} protect you from Holds, Immobilization, Disorient, Knockback, Repel, and enemy Teleportation, as well as smashing and energy damage"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1228522254" ""+Res(Special)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1912899325" "Your Resistance to Smashing and Energy attacks has been increased.  You are more resistant to Hold, Disorient, Immobilize, Knockback, Repel and enemy Teleport attacks, but your movement rates are slightly reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Speed Boost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3686758356" "Speed Boost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P146937202" "Ranged, Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// Power Help Text :
"P553862191" "You can hasten a single targeted ally. The target's movement speed, attack rate, and Endurance recovery are all greatly increased and the target gains resistance to Slow effects. You cannot use this power on yourself. Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P922167688" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, Res Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1810162801" "You've been granted a Speed Boost.  Your Attack speed, Endurance recovery and Running speed are all increased and you are resistant to Slow effects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Inertial Reduction 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4081596977" "Inertial Reduction"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3810722637" "PBAoE, Allies +Jump"
// Power Help Text :
"P2315677234" "You can reduce your Inertia, along with that of all nearby allies. The affected allies can then jump incredible distances for a while. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1459003196" "+Jump"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2340966442" "Your inertia has been reduced, allowing you to make incredible leaps."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Transference 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1682568980" "Transference"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3030858431" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Target -End, Team +Recovery, Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3286788869" "Transference drains an enemy of some of their Endurance and transfers that Endurance to all allies near the affected foe. You can use Transference to recover Endurance for yourself as well as your allies. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P496142339" "-Endurance"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1231917684" "Your Endurance has been drained."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P109883187" "{PlayerSource} drains some of your endurance with their {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fulcrum Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3140221556" "Fulcrum Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3575358054" "Ranged (Foe AoE), Foe -DMG, Team +DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P3127032294" "Fulcrum Shift drains the power of a targeted foe and all foes nearby, transferring it to all adjacent allies, you, and those near you. Affected foes will deal less damage, while your affected allies will deal more. The more foes that are affected, the more power you and your allies receive. Fulcrum Shift can dramatically turn the tide of a battle. Recharge: Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Pain Domination 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3134386314" "Pain Domination"
// DisplayHelp :
"P398776508" "Pain Domination gives a character the ability to manipulate, nullify and amplify pain.  Ultimately this grants the user powerful healing, buffing and debuffing powers.  It's healing output is unmatched!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Nullify Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P175982904" "Nullify Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1906443399" "PBAoE, Team +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P2671953981" "Nullify Pain will heal nearby allies for some hit points by numbing the pain caused by their wounds. Nullify Pain is not as potent as Soothe, but can heal multiple targets at once. Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3262186852" "You nullify some of {PlayerDest}'s pain and heal them for {Damage} points of health."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1319995399" "{PlayerSource} nullifies some of your pain to heal you for {Damage} points of health."

