"P3845271994" "Moonbeam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1619398524" "Sniper, Superior DMG(Negative), Target -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1911637870" "An extremely long range and accurate beam of Negative Energy that deals tremendous damage and reduces the target's chance to hit.  This is a sniper attack, and like most sniper attacks, is best fired from a distance as it can be interrupted. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
