"P1659198204" "Dark Pit"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3003499966" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P3674184750" "Envelops a targeted foe and any nearby enemies in a pit of Negative Energy. The attack deals no damage, but Disorients all affected foes for a good while. Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Tenebrous Tentacles 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2726905308" "Tenebrous Tentacles"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1227418640" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Negative/Smash), Foe Immobilize, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P3492206660" "You can create a cone shaped rift to the Netherworld that allows its native creatures to slip their oily Tentacles into our reality. These creatures will snare all foes within range, Immobilizing them while the Tentacles drain their life and reduce their chance to hit. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
