"P3887098239" "Ranged, High DMG(Negative), Target -To Hit, Self +HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P2353967879" "You can tap the power of the Netherworld to steal some life from a target foe and reduce their chance to hit.  Some of that stolen life is transferred to you in the form of Hit Points. Damage: High Recharge: Moderate"
