"P888501034" "Blackstar"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P524010232" "Close (AoE), Extreme DMG(Negative), Foe -To Hit, Self -Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P2511101398" "You can unleash a devastating blast of Negative Energy around yourself, dealing massive damage and severely reducing affected foes' chance to hit.  This power leaves you drained of Endurance and unable to recover Endurance for a while. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1620961953" "Your chance to hit has been reduced by the Blackstar."
