"P1248113303" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash/Energy), Target Sleep, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P62930663" "Your fists become electrically charged and deliver a powerful punch. Charged Brawl can drain some Endurance from the target and may overload their synapses, leaving it writhing for a moment.  A portion of drained Endurance may be returned to you.  Disturbing an overloaded target will disperse the electrical charge and release the target Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
