// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P665663652" "You can send a large blast of electrical energy at a foe, dealing high damage and draining some Endurance. Some of this Endurance may transfer back to you. Lightning Bolt deals more damage than Charged Bolts, but recharges more slowly. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

