// Power Help Text :
"P141045042" "Immobilizes a group of foes within earthy formations and deals some Smashing damage over time. Slower and less damaging than Stone Prison, but can capture multiple targets. Stone Cages can also reduce a target's Defense. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
