"P2960001225" "Fire Cages"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1407073287" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Fire), Foe Immobilize"
// Power Help Text :
"P3718752007" "Immobilizes a group of foes in Fire Cages, dealing Fire damage over time. More resilient foes may require multiple Fire Cages to Immobilize. Fire Cages is slower and less damaging than Ring of Fire, but can capture multiple targets. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3011391955" "The Fire Cage is burning you and preventing you from moving."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Smoke 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2290599550" "Smoke"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2382461739" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe -Perception, -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P1128361841" "Covers all foes near your target in clouds of Smoke. Your enemies are so blinded that they can hardly see a thing. Most foes will not be able to see past normal melee range, although some may have better perception. If the affected targets are attacked, they will be alerted to your presence, but will suffer a penalty to their chance to hit Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P4109791369" "You have been blinded by the Smoke from {PlayerSource}. Your chance to hit and perception have been reduced."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2217246121" "-Perception, -To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P560515883" "The Smoke is reducing your visual range and chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hot Feet 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P207060483" "Hot Feet"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1558454045" "Toggle: PBAoE, Minor DoT(Fire), Foe -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P1015721464" "While active, you heat the earth in a large area around yourself. Enemy movement is Slowed as they attempt to flee the immediate area. All foes in the affected area may suffer some damage over time.  You cannot fly and must be near the ground to use this power. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2705814161" "The ground is extremely hot and burning you.  Your running speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1720389203" "You activate {PowerName} and burn {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of fire damage, and slow their movement speed."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4004658549" "{PlayerSource} burns you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage and reduces your movement speed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Flashfire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3161065910" "Flashfire"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3890830914" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Fire), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1598889486" "You can bring forth a Flashfire to Disorient a group of foes and deal some damage over time. Target must be on the ground to activate Flashfire. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2501905848" "You have been disoriented."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1517957279" "Your {PowerName} deals {Damage} points of fire damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2355673311" "{PlayerSource} burns you withtheir{PowerName} for {Damage} points of fire damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
