"P265849818" "Crushing Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1348701880" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Minor DoT(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P1432813375" "Creates a large gravitational field strong enough to Immobilize multiple foes. Crushing Field can also bring down flying entities. Slower and less damaging than Crush, but can capture multiple targets. Crushing Field deals Smashing damage over time and can Slow the movement of targets that escape its grasp. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1512920980" "You increase the gravity around {PlayerDest} and crush them for {Damage} points of smashing damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4248602804" "{PlayerSource} increases the gravity around you and crushes you for {Damage} points of smashing damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dimension Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3572177719" "Dimension Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3728867518" "Your mastery of gravity allows you to manipulate dimensions, bringing multiple foes out of sync with reality. Your foes become completely intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space. Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2953255080" "You have been shifted into an alternate dimension.  You powers cannot effect anyone but yourself, but you cannot be harmed."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1416991946" "You shift {PlayerDest} into another dimension rendering them intangible!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4172529713" "{PlayerSource} shift you into another dimension.  You are now intangible, and cannot affect or be affected by those in normal space."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1734923335" "You shift {PlayerDest} into another dimension.  He is now intangible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Gravity Distortion Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3577978297" "Gravity Distortion Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3095732666" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Hold"
// Power Help Text :
"P919459034" "Creates a large, intensely misshapen Gravity Distortion Field that encompasses several foes, rendering them unable to take any action. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1398717329" "You contain {PlayerDest} within your {PowerName} holding them!"
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1172480868" "{PlayerSource} contains you within their {PowerName} holding you!"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P169853037" "You are being held in a Gravity Distortion Field."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Wormhole 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P704570369" "Wormhole"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4052788000" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Foe Teleport, Disorient, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1807841529" "You can open a gravitational Wormhole behind a targeted foe and violently push him, and all nearby foes, through it. The victims are sent flying out the other end of the Wormhole and are left Disoriented. You determine the location of the Wormhole's end, and can place it high in the air if desired. More powerful foes may be resistant to the Wormhole effects. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2029583855" "You teleport {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} disorienting them."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P324228789" "{PlayerSource} teleports you with their {PowerName} disorienting you!"
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Singularity 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1747473765" "Singularity"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1654473077" "Summon Singularity: Ranged Control Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3199467779" "You can create a very powerful Gravitational Singularity.  The Singularity will engage your foes, assaulting them with various gravity powers.  Any foes that attempt to approach the Singularity will be violently hurled away.  The Singularity cannot be healed, but is highly resistant to all forms of damage and nearly impervious to Controlling type powers.  Recharge: Very Long"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ice Control 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2899985889" "Ice Control"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4141548241" "You can draw moisture from the air to create Icy formations. With these abilities, you can control ice with remarkable precision to dominate your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chilblain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2787247941" "Chilblain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1689686328" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Cold), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1117927853" "Immobilizes your target in an icy trap, dealing some Cold damage over time as well as slightly slowing the target's attack and movement speed. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1003436427" "DoT(Cold), Immobilize, -SPD, -Recharge"
