// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ice Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2897888827" "Ice Armor"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1654151997" "You can dramatically reduce your core body temperature to form various armors of ice around yourself. You can protect yourself from many different damage types, and you gain exceptional resistance to Cold based attacks. However, this set offers little protection to Fire based powers and no protection against Psionics."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hide 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frozen Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3142488911" "Frozen Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4171625204" "Self, +Def(Smash, Lethal), +Res(Cold, Fire, DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P594514927" "While this power is active, you coat yourself in rock hard Frozen Armor. The hardness of the Frozen Armor offers good defense to Smashing and Lethal attack as well as reduces Cold damage. Also, Fire attacks deal slightly less damage and you can resist Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3343878400" "You are now more defensive to Smashing and Lethal attacks and resistant to Cold and Fire damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hoarfrost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P638981578" "Hoarfrost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P183553588" "Self Heal, +Max HP, Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2861763711" "Activating this power covers you in a thick layer of Hoarfrost. The frost can absorb the impact from enemy attacks, effectively increasing your maximum Hit Points for a short time. Hoarfrost also grants you resistance to Toxic Damage. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3809918813" "Your {PowerName} increases your maximum Hit Points and grants you some resistance to Toxic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Wet Ice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2198103139" "Wet Ice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3017162935" "Self, +DEF(All but Psionics), +Res(Cold, Disorient, Immobilize, Hold, Sleep, Slow, Knockback, DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3902732113" "When you activate this power, you cover yourself in a thick coating of slick, melting ice. This makes you slippery, leaving you nearly immune to Disorient, Immobilization, Hold, Sleep, Slow and Knockback effects. This power also adds a slight increase to your defense to all attacks except Psionics. Wet Ice also reduces Cold damage and grants you resistance to Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3563968398" "You are now covered in {PowerName}.  Your defense is increased and you are highly resistant to Disorient, Immobilization, Hold, Sleep, Slow and Knockback."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Chilling Embrace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2057726083" "Toggle: PBAoE, Foe -Recharge, -Speed, -DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P2557336091" "While active, you dramatically lower the temperature around yourself, Slowing the attack rate of all nearby foes, as well as their movement speed and damage. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P1654607134" "The {PowerName} from {PlayerSource} slows your attack and movement speed, and reduces your damage."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3655213320" "-Recharge, -SPD, -DMG"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3232901028" "Your Attack speed, Running speed and damage are reduced by the Chilling Embrace."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Permafrost 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1281602581" "Permafrost"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2130246514" "Auto: Self +Res(Cold, Fire, Slow)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2871998345" "Your body temperature permanently lowers to 33 degrees Fahrenheit. Permafrost gives you strong resistance to Cold damage, and some resistance to Fire damage as well. You also gain an inherent resistance to Slow effects. This power is always on and does not cost Endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Glacial Armor 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1453823211" "Glacial Armor"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3691044871" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Energy, Negative), Res (Cold, DeBuff DEF), +Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P1307946765" "When you activate this power you cover yourself in Glacial ice. The crystalline matrix of the armor has refracting properties that make Energy and Negative Energy attacks less likely to land, and acts as a lens to increase your Perception to see hidden foes. The bitter cold of Glacial Armor also reduces Cold damage and also you to resist Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Very Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2847862775" "You are now more defensive to energy and negative energy attacks. You are resistant to Cold and your Perception is increased."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Energy Absorption 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1195620424" "Energy Absorption"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3624183246" "PBAoE, Self +End, +DEF(All but Psionics), Res (Slow), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P2382992896" "Activating this power draws moisture directly from the bodies of all nearby foes, draining their Endurance. Each foe you draw moisture from adds to your own Endurance as well as Defense to all attacks except psionics. The first foe you absorb grants the highest Defense bonus, and you can absorb up to 10 foes.  In addition to Defense, Energy Absorption also grants you resistance to Slow effects. If there are no foes within range, this power will fail. Recharge: Long"
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Icy Bastion 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P475979982" "Icy Bastion"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3143764729" "Self +Res(All DMG, but Psionics), +Res(Knockback, Repel, Disorient, Hold, Immobilize, Sleep), +Regen, +Recovery"
// Power Help Text :
"P1655935982" "You channel an intense cold through yourself, doing so will significantly boost your resistance to all types of damage (except psionics), your resistance to status effects, and your regeneration and recovery rates for a very brief period.  Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3502722092" "You become practically invincible for a very brief time!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ninjitsu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2546782405" "Ninjitsu"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1848136070" "Ninjitsu is the secret art of Ninja.  Many Ninjitsu powers emphasize acute senses that allow you to react deftly to avoid danger. Others focus on the ability to hide in plain sight.  Still others rely on the ancient art of Kuji Kiri, and the pure focus of the mind to accomplish the impossible."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hide 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Ninja Reflexes 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3595433736" "Ninja Reflexes"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2645954271" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Melee), Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1723704579" "Activating your Ninja Reflexes enables you to be more evasive to melee attacks. This will increase your Defense versus melee as long as it is active. Ninja Reflexes also grants you resistance to Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P493374246" "Your Ninja Reflexes allow you to avoid melee attacks."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Danger Sense 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3260963519" "Danger Sense"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2437793024" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Ranged, AoE), +Perception, Res(DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2014726068" "You become more evasive against ranged and area attacks while you have Danger Sense activated. This will increase your Defense versus ranged and Area of Effect attacks as long as it is active. Your Danger Sense also allow you to perceive stealthy foes and resist Defense DeBuffs. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2707102790" "Your Danger Sense allows you to easily avoid ranged attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Caltrops 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2332631327" "You toss a handful of Caltrops at a targeted location and spread the tiny metal spikes over a large area. Any enemy that passes over the Caltrops will be forced to move at a slower rate. They will also take some trivial Lethal damage over time. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Rin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4184330932" "Kuji-In Rin"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2775742065" "Self +Res(Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilize, Confuse, Fear, Psionics)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4081989519" "Kuji-In Rin is the strength of mind and body.  By focusing your power on this exercise, you gain a resistance to Disorient, Hold, Sleep, Immobilization, Confusion, and fear, as well as resistance to Psionic damage for a few minutes. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1416335400" "You are now highly resistant to Disorient, Immobilize, Hold, Sleep, Confusion, Fear and Psionic damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Sha 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1895928915" "Kuji-In Sha"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P3469865187" "Kuji-In Sha invokes the power of Sha, or healing. Focusing your inner power, you can heal your body of its wounds and leave yourself resistant to the effects of Toxic damage for a while. Recharge: Long"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1504742341" "Your {PowerName} heals you for {Damage} points of damage and you are now resistant to Toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Smoke Flash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P120571169" "PBAoE, Foe Placate"
// Power Help Text :
"P1845630287" "You throw a smoke bomb at your feet.  The resulting flash of light and smoke can briefly distract your foes and Placate them so they can no longer find or target you. Combined with Hide, Smoke Flash is the perfect distraction to get out of a bad situation. Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P254088221" "You Placate {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1894553525" "The {PowerName} Placates you and you cannot target {PlayerSource}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blinding Powder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P714432003" "Ranged (Cone), Foe -To Hit, Sleep, Confuse, -Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P1628571656" "You throw a handful of Blinding powder in a wide arc at your foes. Most foes will be blinded, and unable to see. Some affected targets may be overcome by the powder that they may start attacking their own allies. If you attack the blinded foes, they will be alerted to your presence, but will continue to suffer a penalty to their chance to hit.  Recharge: Very Long"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4003397580" "You confuse {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1232881323" "{PlayerSource} has confused you with their {PowerName}"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Kuji-In Retsu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3602318660" "Kuji-In Retsu"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2475738039" "Self +DEF, +SPD, +Recovery, Res(DeBuff DEF), +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2083980006" "Kuji-In Retsu is the mastery of space and time. Focusing your power on Retsu enables you to control your own time to easily defeat your foes. Mastery of this power enables you to avoid almost any attack, be it ranged, melee, or area effect. Your running speed, jumping height and Endurance Recovery are also increased. Retsu also grants you high resistance to Defense DeBuffs. When Retsu wears off, you are left drained of all Endurance and unable to recover Endurance for a while. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Regeneration 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
// DisplayHelp :
"P2495269693" "Regeneration leads to powers that let you regenerate more quickly from damage and effects. Regeneration offers almost no actual damage resistance, but your Hit Point Regeneration can become so incredibly fast, that your wounds heal almost instantly.  Those who possess this power set have little downtime."

