// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P865077483" "You perform a quick punch that deals moderate smashing and energy damage. Coupled with other energy punches, Barrage can Disorient a foe. Damage: Moderate Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Energy Punch 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Help Text :
"P4202438677" "You perform a powerful Energy Punch that deals moderate smashing and energy damage. When used with other Energy Melee attacks, Energy Punch can Disorient your opponent. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bone Smasher 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
