// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2007613400" "A Bone Smasher attack can be slow, but it compensates by dealing a good amount of smashing and energy damage and having a better chance to Disorient than Energy Punch. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

