"P1983949940" "Melee, Medium DMG(Smashing), Foe Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P702006943" "Using intense martial arts focus, you can perform a Cobra Strike that deals minor damage, but has a great chance of Disorienting your target. Damage: Medium, Recharge: Medium"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crane Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P1820988499" "You can perform a slow, high smashing damage kick that will likely knock your target back. Damage: High, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Eagles Claw 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2733210193" "Eagles Claw"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1454154932" "Melee, Superior DMG(Smashing), Foe Minor Disorient, +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2090001082" "You can perform a devastating smashing damage kick that can severely Disorient most opponents. Eagle's Claw has an exceptionally good critical hit capability.  In addition to the normal Critical from attacking while Hidden, there is also a small chance you may land a Critical hit even if you are not Hidden. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1900078763" "You deal {PlayerDest} a critical blow with your {PowerName} for an additional {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3619883057" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a critical blow from their {PowerName} for an extra {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Ninja Sword 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P456380780" "Ninja Blade"
// DisplayHelp :
"P2946740511" "Wield a Ninja Blade and master a variety of powerful Lethal attacks. A quick and elegant weapon, the Ninja Blade can reduce an enemy's Defense. The Ninja Blade is a fine blade that always has a bonus to Accuracy. Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Ninja Blade attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hack 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P4262964925" "You perform a standard attack with your Ninja Blade. This attack is slower than Gambler's Cut, but deals more lethal damage. Sting of the Wasp can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P2867342087" "You perform a quick slash with your Ninja Blade. This attack is very fast, but deals only minor lethal damage. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Slice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P515391207" "You swing your Ninja Blade in a wide arc in front of you, slicing multiple foes with lethal damage. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. If executed while hidden, all affected targets have a chance to be hit with a Critical for extra damage.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Assassin's Blade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3164628714" "Assassin's Blade"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Build Up 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Placate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P3318818798" "Allows you to trick a foe to no longer attack you.  A Successful Placate will also Hide you.  This Hide is very brief, and offers no Defense bonus, but it will allow you to deliver a Critical Hit or an Assassins Blade. However, if you attack a Placated Foe, he will be able to attack you back. Recharge: Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Parry 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
// Power Help Text :
"P4178460927" "You can use your Ninja Blade to parry incoming melee attacks and then quickly return the favor. Divine Avalanche does minor damage, but every successful hit will increase your Defense against melee and lethal attacks for a short while. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Disembowel 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2714891084" "Melee, Superior DMG(Lethal), Foe Knockup, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P32066094" "You perform a powerful Soaring Dragon maneuver that deals a great amount of lethal damage, and can knock a target up into the air. This attack can reduce a target's Defense, making them easier to hit. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Head Splitter 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Help Text :
"P2818835782" "You perform a devastating Golden Dragonfly attack that deals a massive amount of lethal damage and can even knock a foe down to the ground and reduce their Defense. The power of this attack can actually extend a short distance through multiple foes. If executed while hidden, only some affected targets may be hit with a Critical, however, there is a chance you may land a Critical hit with Golden Dragonfly even if you are not Hidden.  Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Spines 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P401332978" "Spines"
// DisplayHelp :
"P1457756702" "Spines protrude from your body and can deal damage in melee or at very short ranges. Spines are hollow and hold a neural toxin that deals additional Toxic damage and can Slow or Immobilize your enemies. The toxin is cumulative, and multiple hits will affect a target more strongly.  Very few foes have resistance to Spine poison. Like all Stalker primary attack powers, Spine attacks can land a Critical Hit for double damage, if you are properly Hidden or if your target is Slept or Held."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Barb Swipe 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P462935467" "Barb Swipe"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2886195292" "Melee, Minor DMG(Lethal), DoT(Toxic), -SPD, -Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P3841240286" "Shred your opponent with several quick Swipes from your Spines. Barb Swipe deals minor lethal damage over time. Spine poison deals additional Toxic damage and Slows affected foes. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P460077861" "DoT(Toxic), -Recharge, -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1898299666" "You are poisoned!  Your Attack speed and Running speed are reduced."
