"P947486191" "You finish up your {PowerName} with a for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2753183345" "{PlayerSource} swipes you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3872693350" "Poison from your Spines deal {damage} points of Toxic damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2056617940" "You take {Damage} points of Toxic damage from {PlayerSource}'s Spines!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
